### Order API Requests

### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@contentType = application/json

###
# Get all orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/order
Accept: {{contentType}}

###
# Get order by ID (existing)
GET {{baseUrl}}/order/1
Accept: {{contentType}}

###
# Get order by ID (non-existent - should return 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/order/99999
Accept: {{contentType}}

###
# Create a new order
POST {{baseUrl}}/order
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "description": "New test order",
  "customer": {
    "id": 99
  }
}

###
# Create order with detailed customer info
POST {{baseUrl}}/order
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "description": "Order for electronics",
  "customer": {
    "id": 2,
    "name": "John Doe"
  }
}
